Z||000003||Cliff Pennock||11-26-1999||04:09 AM||||Voyd, it already does that. Both the forum's main page as the thread pages use icons for new messages. If you are not seeing them your cookies might be messed up. You can delete all cookies set by this forum by clicking on "preferences" on the top of this page, and then click "Click here to delete all cookies...".<P>As for the censored words: yes, I have censored most four letter words. Not only for the obvious reasons, but also to prevent it from being filtered out by surf-watch programs.||||reg||4
