Z||000005||DJRice||11-29-1999||09:23 AM||||Voyd, <P>I fought with this problem and every time I thought I had it figured out, I would lose my lights and books.  You need to bookmark  <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl</A>  and just click through the main page.  That is the only way I have found to consistantly keep the cookies updated.<P>Hope this helps.||||reg||1
